WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.810
- I had one heckler, but I was in a parade

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.408
as Miss Oklahoma City University.

00:00:04.408 --> 00:00:07.044
- Wow, that, you got to that so fast,

00:00:07.044 --> 00:00:09.323
and don't do your water drink,
'cause I know your game.

00:00:09.323 --> 00:00:10.754
You're not on Charlie Rose.

00:00:10.754 --> 00:00:12.824
(sign creaks)

00:00:12.824 --> 00:00:15.127
(upbeat music)

00:00:15.127 --> 00:00:16.669
- A man yelled out, I was sitting,

00:00:16.669 --> 00:00:19.305
sitting, not even standing,
on a back of a car,

00:00:19.305 --> 00:00:22.544
waiting, and he goes, "You're short!"

00:00:22.544 --> 00:00:25.143
I thought, well A, newsflash,

00:00:25.143 --> 00:00:26.800
I know, and B,

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.187
couldn't you have thought
of a better heckle?

00:00:28.187 --> 00:00:30.788
- I typically get, like, "Shut up,

00:00:30.788 --> 00:00:32.346
"you annoying (bleep) tour."

00:00:32.346 --> 00:00:33.356
(gasp)

00:00:33.356 --> 00:00:36.901
Or, "Your smelly hole is
like a fish market," and--

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:38.807
- You get that yelled at you? That's mean.

00:00:38.807 --> 00:00:40.102
- Yes, but what's funny is,

00:00:40.102 --> 00:00:41.994
I sometimes will get it from gay audiences

00:00:41.994 --> 00:00:43.719
as an endearment, like
(laughter)

00:00:43.719 --> 00:00:46.491
"Hey diva, you're my
favorite smelly gash."

00:00:46.491 --> 00:00:48.994
To which I say, "Thank you."

00:00:48.994 --> 00:00:51.256
And I'm very pro-LGBT, as you are as well.

00:00:51.256 --> 00:00:54.236
- Of course, but my gays
will be like, "Brava, diva!"

00:00:54.236 --> 00:00:55.253
That's the difference.

00:00:55.253 --> 00:00:57.069
- My gays are like,

00:00:57.069 --> 00:01:00.964
"Fierce, stinky hole, love your gash."

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:03.597
And you know what?

00:01:03.597 --> 00:01:04.749
That is okay.
- [Kristin] You accept it.

00:01:04.749 --> 00:01:05.767
- [Kathy] I do.

00:01:05.767 --> 00:01:06.787
If a straight guy said that to me,

00:01:06.787 --> 00:01:07.804
by the way, I'd be livid.

00:01:07.804 --> 00:01:08.954
- So tonight, when you're on stage,

00:01:08.954 --> 00:01:11.171
should I go, "I love
you, you stinky whore!"

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:12.383
- Yeah, that's completely acceptable.

00:01:12.383 --> 00:01:14.107
- You think anyone will know it's me?

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.659
- I think if you sing it

00:01:15.659 --> 00:01:16.836
they might know it's you.

00:01:16.836 --> 00:01:18.937
- I love you, you stinky whore.

00:01:18.937 --> 00:01:20.358
- Even you make it sound beautiful.

00:01:20.358 --> 00:01:21.474
- Thank you.

00:01:21.474 --> 00:01:22.474
That's good, that's enough.

00:01:22.474 --> 00:01:23.484
- All right, that's enough.

00:01:23.484 --> 00:01:24.496
- What's your cup say?

00:01:24.496 --> 00:01:26.319
- My cup says, "LOL."

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.294
- Mine says, "Oh my God," or, "OMG."

00:01:28.294 --> 00:01:29.864
What is the red thing? Oh, that's hot.

00:01:29.864 --> 00:01:31.138
- That's the hot water, I think.

